\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-315\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 .    Stand in faith during temptation,
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj So that no tribulation
\par Shall, from Jesus' love distract you
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0\qj Cease discourse, brace yourself up,
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0\qj Yes, His love eternal is,
\par  And He wants you to redeem,
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj The door to your heart you braced up;
\par Will this fact not so distress you?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par    2.   Stick to your faith each Passing day,
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj  Yield not to cheats of the soul.
\par  Faith gets shaken when doubts arise
\par so hold fast unto your God
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj Hold pact of your baptism,
\par  Everyday make it stand firm,
\par  On Him place your thoughts and worries,
\par For it is He who will answer.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   Strongly stick to your faith each day
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj so that you can love the Lord.
\par Show love to your closest neighbour
\par Even as you love yourself.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj If he has offended you,
\par Remember Jesus' pure love,
\par He pleaded for His detractors,
\par And God does forgiveth you too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Hold unto your guide zealously,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And your help will not take long.
\par All the yearnings within your heart
\par God shall with swiftness fulfill.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trust that God is existent;
\par And has compassion for you;
\par Trust you therefore in Him always
\par And you will never suffer shame!
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

